--[[
	Steal An Egg - Eternal / Divine egg grabber (DELTA / MOBILE)

	RELAY BUILD: the hopper, rarity matching and restart logic are the Delta
	grabber's, but every alert is sent in the ORIGINAL notifier format: one
	webhook message that starts with EGGKG + JSON, which your Discord bot cog
	("2worst_kg") turns into the usual embed (kg, mutation, base -> final value,
	kg / value role pings). There is no Roblox user-id lock; the only lock is the
	place id below, so it runs on any account inside Steal An Egg.
	NO WORKSPACE FILE NEEDED: host this file somewhere that serves raw text, set
	the link in the loader, and run the same loader on every device:
	    getgenv().EGG_SCRIPT_URL = "YOUR_RAW_LINK"
	    loadstring(game:HttpGet("YOUR_RAW_LINK"))()
	Each hop then re-downloads the script itself. (Without SCRIPT_URL it falls back
	to a workspace file named "egg-grabber-delta.lua".)

	This is the same grabber as egg-grabber.luau, rebuilt to run on Delta
	Executor on Android and iOS. Same behaviour: land -> hunt for an
	Eternal/Divine/Secret spawn -> POST to Discord -> hop -> repeat. A server
	with no target egg is left straight away (CONFIG.HOP_ON_EMPTY), so the hunt
	keeps moving instead of camping.

	WHAT CHANGED VS THE DESKTOP SCRIPT
	  * Script-side anti-AFK was REMOVED. Steal An Egg's BAC anti-cheat kicks
	    for VirtualUser input, so use Delta's own built-in anti-AFK instead.
	  * clear_teleport_queue / queue_on_teleport are resolved by name, because
	    Delta exposes them as "clearteleportqueue" / "queueonteleport" and
	    calling the wrong name would abort every teleport.
	  * request / http_request are both tried, and JSON goes through
	    HttpService so no executor "json" global is required.
	  * file helpers are wrapped, so a build without them still runs (it just
	    cannot remember eggs between hops).
	  * fixed the missing scalePayoutFactor() and the game:IsLStarted() typo
	    that stopped the old delta attempt from ever starting.
	  * hops are STRICTLY targeted: the matchmaker fallback is off
	    (CONFIG.ALLOW_MATCHMAKER = false), because Teleport() drops us into
	    crowded servers we cannot hop out of.
	  * the server search reads up to CONFIG.LIST_PAGES pages of the quietest-
	    first list and merges them, aiming DEEP (CONFIG.TARGET_DEPTH) at the 2/7
	    servers most first-page bots never see. Pages are spaced by only
	    CONFIG.LIST_PAGE_GAP seconds and 429s are retried, so the multi-page
	    scrape stays fast instead of costing a 3s wait per page.
	  * eggs are posted ONE MESSAGE PER EGG (full single-egg detail), instead of
	    bundling two spawns into one "2 TARGET EGGS" card. If a spawn held two
	    eggs and one is stolen, the leftover is reported as that one egg alone,
	    never as part of a stale two-egg card.
	  * Halloween Dimension world eggs (Eternal/Divine/Secret) are reported to
	    CONFIG.WEBHOOK_HALLOWEEN with the VIP ping. They are (almost) always up,
	    so this is purely additive - never a reason to hop, hold or scan for a
	    boss.

	HOW IT RESTARTS AFTER A HOP
	  Every hop queues a tiny bootstrap that reloads this file after the new
	  server loads. For that to work the file must live in Delta's workspace
	  as "egg-grabber-delta.lua". If your Delta build cannot queue teleports,
	  put this same file (or egg-grabber-delta-autoexec.lua) in Delta's
	  AutoExec folder instead - it re-runs on every game join.

	KILL SWITCH: getgenv().EGG_GRABBER_STOP = true
	STOP FILE  : put a literal "1" in egg-grabber-delta-stop.txt
	SET WEBHOOK below before running.
]]

