-- eggs and pets on the map contain that and caused false alerts.
-- Anything with "egg" in the name is skipped as extra insurance.
-- One Workspace pass per scan, early-out on match, everything inside pcall.
-- Returns (active, evidence).
local bossAlerted = {}
